<header class="tema-hero">
<div class="container" style="max-width:1100px">
<div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Início</a> / <a href="/ferramentas/">Ferramentas</a> / Calculadora de TCO</div>
<h1 class="page-title">Calculadora de Custo Total de Propriedade (TCO)</h1>
<p>Avalie o custo real de manter um ativo na frota. Inclui todos os custos diretos e indiretos ao longo da vida útil. Compare: Comprar novo, Comprar usado, Alugar (rental), Terceirizar operação completa.</p>
</div>
</header>

<section class="container" style="padding-top:24px;padding-bottom:80px;max-width:1100px">

<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 440px;gap:32px;align-items:start">
<div>
<h2 class="section-title section-title-h3" style="margin-bottom:20px">Dados do Equipamento</h2>

<div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--cinza-claro);border-radius:14px;padding:24px;margin-bottom:16px">
<h3 style="font-family:var(--font-titulo);font-size:18px;font-weight:600;margin:0 0 16px;color:var(--texto-escuro)">Identificação</h3>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px">
<label class="form-conta" style="margin:0">
<span>Código / Tag</span>
<input type="text" id="codTco" placeholder="Ex: EXC-001" style="font-family:inherit;padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid var(--cinza-claro);border-radius:8px;background:#fff;font-size:16px;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box">
</label>
<label class="form-conta" style="margin:0">
<span>Categoria</span>
<select id="catTco" style="font-family:inherit;padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid var(--cinza-claro);border-radius:8px;background:#fff;font-size:16px;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box">
<option value="escavadeira">Escavadeira</option>
<option value="pacarreira">Pá Carregadeira</option>
<option value="motoniveladora">Motoniveladora</option>
<option value="rolo">Rolo Compactador</option>
<option value="plataforma">Plataforma Tesoura/Articulada</option>
<option value="guindaste">Guindaste</option>
<option value="gerador">Gerador</option>
<option value="compressor">Compressor</option>
<option value="outro">Outro</option>
</select>
</label>
</div>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px;margin-top:16px">
<label class="form-conta" style="margin:0">
<span>Marca / Modelo</span>
<input type="text" id="modTco" placeholder="Ex: Caterpillar 320D" style="font-family:inherit;padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid var(--cinza-claro);border-radius:8px;background:#fff;font-size:16px;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box">
</label>
<label class="form-conta" style="margin:0">
<span>Condição</span>
<select id="condTco" style="font-family:inherit;padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid var(--cinza-claro);border-radius:8px;background:#fff;font-size:16px;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box">
<option value="novo">Novo (0h)</option>
<option value="usado">Usado (horas existentes)</option>
</select>
</label>
</div>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px;margin-top:16px" id="linhaHorasUsado" style="display:none">
<label class="form-conta" style="margin:0">
<span>Horas atuais (se usado)</span>
<input type="number" id="hrsUsadoTco" step="10" min="0" value="3000" style="font-family:inherit;padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid var(--cinza-claro);border-radius:8px;background:#fff;font-size:16px;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box">
</label>
</div>
</div>

<div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--cinza-claro);border-radius:14px;padding:24px;margin-bottom:16px">
<h3 style="font-family:var(--font-titulo);font-size:18px;font-weight:600;margin:0 0 16px;color:var(--texto-escuro)">Aquisição e Vida Útil</h3>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px">
<label class="form-conta" style="margin:0">
<span>Preço de compra (R$)</span>
<input type="number" id="precoCompra" step="1000" min="0" value="350000" style="font-family:inherit;padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid var(--cinza-claro);border-radius:8px;background:#fff;font-size:16px;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box">
</label>
<label class="form-conta" style="margin:0">
<span>Vida útil total (horas)</span>
<input type="number" id="vidaUtilTco" step="100" min="1000" max="50000" value="12000" style="font-family:inherit;padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid var(--cinza-claro);border-radius:8px;background:#fff;font-size:16px;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box">
</label>
</div>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px;margin-top:16px">
<label class="form-conta" style="margin:0">
<span>Valor residual estimado (R$)</span>
<input type="number" id="valResidual" step="1000" min="0" value="50000" style="font-family:inherit;padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid var(--cinza-claro);border-radius:8px;background:#fff;font-size:16px;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box">
</label>
<label class="form-conta" style="margin:0">
<span>Horas/ano planejadas</span>
<input type="number" id="hrsAno" step="100" min="500" max="4000" value="2000" style="font-family:inherit;padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid var(--cinza-claro);border-radius:8px;background:#fff;font-size:16px;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box">
</label>
</div>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px;margin-top:16px">
<label class="form-conta" style="margin:0">
<span>Financiado? % do valor</span>
<input type="number" id="pctFinTco" step="1" min="0" max="100" value="60" style="font-family:inherit;padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid var(--cinza-claro);border-radius:8px;background:#fff;font-size:16px;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box">
</label>
<label class="form-conta" style="margin:0">
<span>Taxa financiamento (% a.a.)</span>
<input type="number" id="taxaFin" step="0.1" min="0" max="30" value="13.5" style="font-family:inherit;padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid var(--cinza-claro);border-radius:8px;background:#fff;font-size:16px;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box">
</label>
</div>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px;margin-top:16px">
<label class="form-conta" style="margin:0">
<span>Prazo financiamento (meses)</span>
<input type="number" id="prazoFin" step="1" min="1" max="120" value="48" style="font-family:inherit;padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid var(--cinza-claro);border-radius:8px;background:#fff;font-size:16px;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box">
</label>
<label class="form-conta" style="margin:0">
<span>WACC / Custo capital próprio (% a.a.)</span>
<input type="number" id="waccTco" step="0.1" min="0" max="50" value="14.5" style="font-family:inherit;padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid var(--cinza-claro);border-radius:8px;background:#fff;font-size:16px;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box">
</label>
</div>
</div>

<div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--cinza-claro);border-radius:14px;padding:24px;margin-bottom:16px">
<h3 style="font-family:var(--font-titulo);font-size:18px;font-weight:600;margin:0 0 16px;color:var(--texto-escuro)">Custos Operacionais Anuais</h3>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px">
<label class="form-conta" style="margin:0">
<span>Combustível (R$/ano)</span>
<input type="number" id="combAnual" step="1000" min="0" value="72000" style="font-family:inherit;padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid var(--cinza-claro);border-radius:8px;background:#fff;font-size:16px;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box">
</label>
<label class="form-conta" style="margin:0">
<span>Operador dedicado (R$/ano)</span>
<input type="number" id="opAnual" step="1000" min="0" value="54000" style="font-family:inherit;padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid var(--cinza-claro);border-radius:8px;background:#fff;font-size:16px;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box">
</label>
</div>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px;margin-top:16px">
<label class="form-conta" style="margin:0">
<span>Manutenção preventiva (R$/ano)</span>
<input type="number" id="prevAnual" step="1000" min="0" value="15000" style="font-family:inherit;padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid var(--cinza-claro);border-radius:8px;background:#fff;font-size:16px;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box">
</label>
<label class="form-conta" style="margin:0">
<span>Manutenção corretiva (R$/ano)</span>
<input type="number" id="corrAnual" step="1000" min="0" value="25000" style="font-family:inherit;padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid var(--cinza-claro);border-radius:8px;background:#fff;font-size:16px;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box">
</label>
</div>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px;margin-top:16px">
<label class="form-conta" style="margin:0">
<span>Seguro (R$/ano)</span>
<input type="number" id="segAnual" step="1000" min="0" value="7800" style="font-family:inherit;padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid var(--cinza-claro);border-radius:8px;background:#fff;font-size:16px;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box">
</label>
<label class="form-conta" style="margin:0">
<span>Rastreamento/Telemetria (R$/ano)</span>
<input type="number" id="rastAnual" step="100" min="0" value="1800" style="font-family:inherit;padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid var(--cinza-claro);border-radius:8px;background:#fff;font-size:16px;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box">
</label>
</div>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px;margin-top:16px">
<label class="form-conta" style="margin:0">
<span>Pneus/Esteiras desgaste (R$/ano)</span>
<input type="number" id="pneusAnual" step="1000" min="0" value="12000" style="font-family:inherit;padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid var(--cinza-claro);border-radius:8px;background:#fff;font-size:16px;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box">
</label>
<label class="form-conta" style="margin:0">
<span>Outros (lubrificantes, filtros, etc.)</span>
<input type="number" id="outrosAnual" step="1000" min="0" value="6000" style="font-family:inherit;padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid var(--cinza-claro);border-radius:8px;background:#fff;font-size:16px;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box">
</label>
</div>
</div>

<div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--cinza-claro);border-radius:14px;padding:24px;margin-bottom:16px">
<h3 style="font-family:var(--font-titulo);font-size:18px;font-weight:600;margin:0 0 16px;color:var(--texto-escuro)">Alternativas de Comparação</h3>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px">
<label class="form-conta" style="margin:0">
